<title>USA: PACE Health signs pact with Kan. hospital.</title>
<headline>PACE Health signs pact with Kan. hospital.</headline>
<dateline>WEST DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PACE Health Management Systems Inc said Wednesday it signed an agreement to provide its Care Management System to Cushing Memorial Hospital Hospital in Leavenworth, Kan.</p>
<p>It said the software programs will enable Cushing's clinicians to spend more time with patients.  The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>PACE Health develops and markets advanced patient care management software.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
